<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T ( 7. Parent Education: Workshops, parent training sessions, and community events are regularly held to support the development of strong family structures. ECLA is a trusted resource within the Ethiopian community, receiving calls from around California and facilitating resource referrals. )
