203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (At our organization, we are privileged to work with volunteers who go above and beyond for our community, and Selam is a shining example of that dedication. Her passion for mental health is not just her chosen field but a calling that drives her to make a real difference in the lives of others.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
