/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Not only does Selam take the initiative in all that she does, but she also makes the extra effort to interpret at workshops, ensuring that language is never a barrier to receiving help. Her ability to create bilingual documents for the organization further ensures that our services are inclusive and accessible to all members of our community. Her kind, supportive nature resonates throughout the organization. She is always there for her fellow volunteers, offering a helping hand or words of encouragement, making her an essential part of our family.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Selam, thank you for your unwavering dedication, leadership, and compassion. You truly embody the spirit of volunteerism, and we are incredibly fortunate to have you on our team.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
