>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For the past two years, Tedjitou has been the heart and soul of our Seniors' Team, serving with unparalleled dedication, empathy, and an unwavering commitment to our elder community. Her journey began by simply knocking on doors, canvassing the neighborhood to better understand the needs of our senior citizens. What started as an introduction soon blossomed into deep, meaningful relationships built on trust, care, and mutual respect.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With her sharp intuition and genuine compassion, Tedjiou took it upon herself to develop a program that has become a lifeline for so many. She has visited seniors in their homes, listened to their concerns, and gone above and beyond to ensure their voices are heard. At times, she has even accompanied them to various offices, acting as an advocate and supporter, helping them navigate the complex systems to get the assistance they need.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Thank you, Tedjitou, for your tireless dedication, your compassionate heart, and for showing us what it truly means to care. You are a shining light in our community, and we are forever grateful for the difference you continue to make in the lives of our seniors.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
